#. module: base_setup
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_base_setup
msgid ""
"\n"
"This module helps to configure the system at the installation of a new "
"database.\n"
"================================================================================\n"
"\n"
"Shows you a list of applications features to install from.\n"
"\n"
